### Global Variables
@api = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products
@id = 2

### 1. General query (Get all active products)
GET {{api}}/getAll
Content-Type: application/json

### 1b. Query by ID (Get an active product by ID)
GET {{api}}/getById/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Create a new product
POST {{api}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Gamer ASUS",
  "price": 25000.50,
  "stock": 10,
  "description": "High performance laptop",
  "brand": "ASUS",
  "img": "image_url.jpg"
}

### 3. Complete update of the created product (Replace 1 with the newly created ID)
PUT {{api}}/update/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Gamer ASUS ROG",
  "price": 26000.00,
  "stock": 5,
  "description": "Improved high performance laptop",
  "brand": "ASUS",
  "img": "new_image_url.jpg"
}

### 3b. Change price exclusively (PATCH)
PATCH {{api}}/change-price/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 24000.99
}

### 4. Logical deletion of the product (Soft delete)
DELETE {{api}}/delete/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5a. Verification: Check that the deleted product no longer appears in getAll
GET {{api}}/getAll
Content-Type: application/json

### 5b. Verification: Check that the deleted product no longer appears in getById
GET {{api}}/getById/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 6a. Non-existent ID case
GET {{api}}/getById/99999
Content-Type: application/json

### 6b. Invalid data case
PATCH {{api}}/change-price/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": -500
}